# `data/` holds only small DERIVED artifacts (annotations, manifests, eval
# reports) -- the DVC-tracked pipeline outputs.
#
# Image datasets are NOT stored here. They are curated source data on the NAS
# under `paths.datasets_root`
# (/mnt/Pool_IA/IA_Dataset/datasets/uav-few-shot-identification/) and referenced
# by the training stage as an external DVC dep, so their hash is recorded in
# dvc.lock at `dvc repro` time.
#
#   annotations/  COCO/JSON annotations, split manifests
#   eval/         open-set evaluation reports (openset_val.json, ...)
